<title>POLAND: Polish budget deficit is PLN 9.12 bln in 1996.</title>
<headline>Polish budget deficit is PLN 9.12 bln in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's budget deficit widened by 4.21 billion zlotys in December to 9.12 billion zlotys for the whole of 1996, amounting to 89.8 percent of the planned 1996 gap of 10.16 billion zlotys, preliminary finance ministry data showed.</p>
</text>
